<title>GERMANY: Wuensche sells parts of fodder business.</title>
<headline>Wuensche sells parts of fodder business.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Wuensche AG said on Thursday it was selling to Peter Cremer GmbH &amp; Co its feedstuffs business which generates around 120 million marks in annual turnover.</p>
<p>Among the disposals were operations making milk powder and milk by-product casein, as well as grain fodder. No price was disclosed for the sale.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
